[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3361.67, "timestamp": "00:56:01", "text": "这个节日也提供了这样的机会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3365.27, "timestamp": "00:56:05", "text": "连衣裙就像衣服一样，也像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3366.789, "timestamp": "00:56:06", "text": "垫子一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3371.75, "timestamp": "00:56:11", "text": "因为它们都有优惠等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3374.789, "timestamp": "00:56:14", "text": "是的，鲜榨果汁来了。 你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3376.87, "timestamp": "00:56:16", "text": "吗？ 回来的路上，我可能会买杯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3403.829, "timestamp": "00:56:43", "text": "嗯，我想应该有一部关于这个的电影。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3407.43, "timestamp": "00:56:47", "text": "是的，我们可以看到一些……嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3411.109, "timestamp": "00:56:51", "text": "清真寺就在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3415.109, "timestamp": "00:56:55", "text": "瞧，是这里的居民干的。"}]